nsored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7762a2d651a96aa191a787e3a5dd605", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7762a2d651a96aa191a787e3a5dd605, https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=877a336fde84039753f1cfd9e23caa35 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=69571d27eb1e32fafc488d877fc8f02f 3x"}, "body": "Hello, Mr. Goma!\nI absolutely love all the fan art you draw! The lively interactions between the characters and their adorable expressions\u2026\nYour understanding of the characters (or actors?) is also really interesting, and I\u2019m completely captivated by it! I think both your colors and lines are beautiful\u2014they feel so free and expressive!\nWould you be willing to draw my two original characters?\n\n\u25b6 Reference/Details\nA handsome detective in men\u2019s clothing and his all-powerful older assistant.\nA villainous duo, a middle-aged married couple. An older man \u00d7 a beautiful cross-dresser. A good guy and a bad girl. A loud, outgoing partner. A yakuza-turned-detective who loves pranks and his assistant. Friends! Cheers!\n\nTwo wolves. A dog-themed couple. (BG with a BL vibe (?)) A partner-style couple.\n\n\u25b3 One-Eyed: Detective. Domineering, polite, and sarcastic. He always uses honorifics. He loves acting and talking. He\u2019s always smiling. He has OCD and prefers things that feel nice to the touch (including \u2193), which is why he collects so many stuffed animals.\n\n\u25b3 Tanned Skin: The all-powerful assistant who\u2019s great at fighting. He has a Showa-era uncle vibe\u2014ferocious, intimidating, and a bit of a delinquent. But with his wife, he\u2019s just a clumsy, straightforward guy who\u2019s totally trustworthy. He can transform into a werewolf. (Sometimes he can\u2019t control it.) He can transform a little for his partner (fluffy ears and a tail).\n\n\u25b6 (Detailed profile available) URL: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-5yiCmVf35jIV3kuUhgx1Pci7f-809Ih?usp=drive_link\n\n\n\u25b6 Content\n\u25b6 An atmosphere where ordinary people work is fine; a cool villain vibe is fine; a lovey-dovey, goofy couple vibe is fine; a mature atmosphere is fine; a vibe where they\u2019re so close that it feels like they\u2019re not close at all is fine; a comedy manga vibe is fine\u2026 and so on.\nPlease feel free to draw whatever interests you. Feel free to choose their outfits and parodies; it\u2019s okay to change them however you like. You can also choose ages other than the parody ones.\nEven something as simple as a doodle page is perfectly fine. I\u2019m really looking forward to seeing the interactions between the characters you draw, your interpretation of them, and more.\n\nBasically, after reviewing the settings, anything goes!\n\nIf you have any rejected roughs or sketches, I\u2019d love to see them.\n\n\u25b6If the budget is insufficient, please let me know so I can adjust it. If that\u2019s difficult, feel free to cancel the order directly.\nThank you very much.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@komagoma/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2640563, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b859087f/uploads/origins/2631700d-5e51-45e4-8464-2b3f2b99fcda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2195bfb2e89643f71d0c595e